{"id":"nechto","lemma":"нечто","pos":"pron","rank":605,"glosses":["something"],"audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/3/38/Ru-%D0%BD%D0%B5%D1%87%D1%82%D0%BE.ogg/Ru-%D0%BD%D0%B5%D1%87%D1%82%D0%BE.ogg.mp3","examples":[{"text":"Это нечто, что я должен сделать.","en":"This is something I have to do.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/651198","words":[{"g":"this / it is"},null,{"g":"what / that"},{"g":"I"},{"g":"must, have to"},{"g":"to make, to do"}]},{"text":"Как ты можешь говорить нечто подобное?","en":"How can you say something like that?","words":[{"g":"how / like"},{"g":"you"},{"g":"can, be able to","l":"мочь"},{"g":"to speak, to talk"},null,{"g":"something like that"}]},{"text":"Почему ты хотел бы сделать нечто подобное?","en":"Why would you want to do something like that?","words":[{"g":"why"},{"g":"you"},{"g":"to want, to desire","l":"хотеть"},{"g":"would"},{"g":"to make, to do"},null,{"g":"something like that"}]},{"text":"Том действительно нечто.","en":"Tom is really something.","words":[{"g":"that one, those ones","l":"тот"},{"g":"really"},null]},{"text":"Вы просто нечто.","en":"You really are something.","words":[{"g":"you (pl. / formal)"},{"g":"simply, plainly, just"},null]}]}